<title>HUNGARY: TABLE-ARANYPOK H1 PRE-TAX PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ARANYPOK H1 PRE-TAX PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Jan-June 1997   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>     Operating profit	   39.0	vs    36.1</p>
<p>     Pre-tax profit	     14.3	vs    28.3</p>
<p>     Net sales		   749.6	vs   671.2</p>
<p>     Other revenue		 4.5	vs    32.9</p>
<p>     Direct costs of sales   625.5	vs   557.2</p>
<p>     Indirect costs of sales  74.8	vs    66.4</p>
<p>     Other expenditures	 14.7	vs    44.4</p>
<p>     Net financial inocme     24.7 loss vs     7.8 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	  2.2	vs     1.1</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure   26.9	vs     9.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Aranypok Kereskedelmi Rt is a clother retailer.</p>
<p>The figures were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
